erò si incontrerà presto con quello del generale romano Lucius, con cui proteggerà la sovranità della Cina dalle mire del folle Tiberius.","tagline":"Quando l'impero romano si scontrò con l'oriente"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Dragon Blade","overview":"Huo An, the commander of the Protection Squad of the Western Regions, was framed by evil forces and becomes enslaved. On the other hand, a Roman general escapes to China after rescuing the Prince. The heroic duo meet in the Western Desert and a thrilling story unfolds.","tagline":"When the Eagle meets the Dragon"},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"天将雄师","overview":"西汉汉元帝年间，西域都护府大都护霍安（成龙 饰）遭奸人陷害，沦为奴役，被刺配至雁门关修城。恰在此时，罗马将军卢魁斯（约翰·库萨克 John Cusack 饰）护卫遭到哥哥迫害的罗马小王子（西蒙子 饰）逃命至雁门关。双雄在西域戈壁相遇，从开始的兵戎相见到惺惺相惜，最终化敌为友。一日，霍安为洗清自己冤屈四处追查时，无意间撞破了好兄弟殷破（崔始源 饰）与罗马大王子提比斯（艾德里安·布洛迪 Adrien Brody 饰）不可告人的秘密。与此同时，提比斯为追杀卢魁斯与小王子一行人也亲自带兵赶来西域。为保护小王子和西域诸国的安危，霍安与卢魁斯联手与提比斯在戈壁大漠展开了一场生死之战"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u1uMnDHoJw8NQCOFiD4w5a3pHiA.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rnNkUJlo03a8D0utxiOrADstaMT.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":300168,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u1uMnDHoJw8NQCOFiD4w5a3pHiA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u1uMnDHoJw8NQCOFiD4w5a3pHiA.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u1uMnDHoJw8NQCOFiD4w5a3pHiA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u1uMnDHoJw8NQCOFiD4w5a3pHiA.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hrEbZNZQ385i4snYWyCDpYrEofO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hrEbZNZQ385i4snYWyCDpYrEofO.jpg","language":"en","widt